{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "744f67a1-4290-86d8-bf58-28a4d4301944",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T12:07:13-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniela Morales",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:05:24-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good afternoon, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:05:29-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good afternoon. My name is Daniela Morales. I need to get a copy of a death certificate, to settle an estate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:05:36-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can help with that. Whose certificate is it, and did the person pass here in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:05:42-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. So last week, Wednesday, my brother-in-law passed at the hospital there in Newport. Then Thursday the funeral home told me the record should be filed by now. And I'm the executor, so the bank wants a certified copy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:05:54-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry for your loss. Yes, if he passed in Newport we'd have it, as long as the funeral home has filed it. They usually do within a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:06:04-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And what ID do I need to bring? Is my driver's license enough, or do I need the paperwork showing I'm the executor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:06:12-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bring a current photo ID, the license is fine. And since you're handling the estate, bring whatever document shows you're the executor, like the appointment papers from probate. That helps show you're entitled to the copy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:06:24-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I have those from the court. Funny, my cousin used to have your job, sitting in that office. Years ago. He always said people forget the paperwork."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:06:33-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, he was right. That's the thing that trips people up most. Are you coming in person?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:06:39-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll come in. What hours are you open? I could come tomorrow morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:06:44-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're open weekdays during regular business hours, so tomorrow morning is fine. Come to the counter at City Hall and ask for vital records."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:06:52-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Should I get more than one copy? The bank, and maybe the insurance."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:06:57-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A lot of people ask for a few, since each place wants its own certified one. I'd say get what you think you'll need so you don't have to come back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:07:07-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right, I'll do that. Thank you, Sandra."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:07:10-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Morales. See you tomorrow."
    }
  ],
